  "title": "UK ATC DELAYS SOAR 80% AS NATS CANNOT COVER STAFF ABSENCE (13 AUG)",
  "summary": "NATS STAFF SHORTAGES DELAY 6,000 RYANAIR PASSENGERS UK ATC DELAYS UP OVER 80% VS LAST YEAR Ryanair, Europe’s No.1 airline, today (Thurs, 13 Aug) demanded that NATS urgently explain why repeated UK ATC staff shortages delayed over 30 Ryanair flights and disrupted almost 6,000 passengers before breakfast this morning. These avoidable staff shortages caused almost 8 hours of cumulative flight delays before 9am alone, once again exposing NATS’ failure to properly resource the UK ATC […]",
